UID: ICD-8
TITLE: TTS Audio Out (tts → speaker)
COMM_TYPE: DDS Topic
SOURCE: tts_node
TARGET: speaker_node
TOPIC: /bridge/cmd/audio_out
MSG_TYPE: g1_onboard_msgs/AudioPCM
QOS: Reliable
